# Auto detect text files and normalize line endings to LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Source
*.js text
*.jsx text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.json text
*.css text
*.scss text
*.html text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
